  "title": "Record a workplace inspection and findings",
  "intro": "Record a workplace inspection: the legal basis, the findings with their evidence and severity, and the corrective actions. A finding is corrected only by a new version; an allegation is never a finding.",
  "owner": "labour",
  "filled_by": "A labour inspector with inspection authority, signed in.",
  "authority": "The labour authority the nation names for the labour slot (authorityFor('labour'), shipped empty). Never a ministry by name.",
